                        "entry_id": "996167a5-eada-3393-83d2-0e299e2c72f2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A native or inhabitant of the Rhineland, a geographic area partly overlapping the states of North Rhine-Westphalia and Rhineland-Palatinate, Germany."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
